==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage only requires two things: [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Bring [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] for a faster win.

==Trivia==
*The stage name includes [[wikipedia:Catechin|catechin]], an antioxidant found in plants.

